<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-background has-medium-font-size" style="background-color:#a3cce5"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">About Rustomjee Summit Project:</span></h2>



<p>Rustomjee Summit at Borivali East is A Premium Residential Project Developed By Rustomjee Group One of The Most Well Known Developer In The City. </p>



<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Rustomjee Summit is, Located in The heart of Rajendra Nagar, Borivali East, Mumbai. This Residential Project Redefines Luxury, Offering an Unparalleled Blend of Modernity And Convenience.</span> This Project Homes Offers Beautiful Views, Spacious Designs in Flat Layouts with Maximum Usability of Areas Given. This Project Facilitates Seamless Connectivity to Important Places In The Mumbai.</p>



<div style="height:81px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



