<h2 class="wp-block-heading" style="font-size:24px">To See other Properties from Rustomjee Group Click <a href="https://propdecide.com/developer/rustomjee/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">All Projects</a></h2>



<div class="wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-8cf370e7 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<details class="wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow" style="font-size:6px"><summary>Info</summary>
<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-left has-small-font-size" style="font-style:normal;font-weight:400"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><em><strong>Rustomjee Summit Location</strong>:</em></span> </h3>



<p class="has-text-align-left has-small-font-size"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Situated homes in one of Mumbai&#8217;s most coveted neighborhoods, Rustomjee Summit at Borivali East, Mumbai. </span>E<span style="font-weight: 400;">njoy seamless connectivity to key landmarks and infrastructure. Rustomjee Summit&#8217;s strategic location ensures effortless access. Highways, railway stations, business hubs, renowned educational institutions, healthcare facilities, and entertainment destinations.</span> <span style="font-weight: 400;">Are you ready to dive into the beating heart of Borivali East at Mumbai? Whether you&#8217;re a Borivali resident or a visitor</span>,<span style="font-weight: 400;"> homes at Borivali East, Mumbai has an vibrant attractions that beckon exploration. From Borivali&#8217;s bustling streets to its cultural hubs, this Mumbai gem offers a tapestry of experiences waiting to be discovered.</span> <span style="font-weight: 400;">One of the most compelling aspects of Borivali East at Mumbai is its diverse culinary scene. Venture into the streets lined with eateries serving up a fusion of flavors, from traditional local to international food.</span></p>



